<node id="Affluent">
  <data key="d0">Affluent</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The term "Affluent" refers to a classification of individuals who possess a significant level of wealth and financial resources, typically above average but below the threshold defined for High Net Worth (HNW) individuals. This category encompasses clients who, like Maria Montgomery, Kenneth Fowler, Chelsea Hernandez, James Collins, and Rodney Owens, have substantial investments and financial assets, allowing them to engage in luxury services and seek specialized financial advice.

Affluent clients are characterized by their financial capacity, which enables them to have distinct financial needs and goals that differentiate them from the general population. While they do not reach the extreme wealth levels associated with HNW individuals, the affluent segment represents a vital market more affluent than average consumers. These individuals often seek services tailored to their financial status, such as premium investment opportunities and wealth management strategies.

Overall, "Affluent" captures a distinct group within the financial landscape, denoting a population of clients who are financially well-off and typically interested in enhancing their wealth through prudent investments and exclusive financial offerings. This classification plays a crucial role in understanding client demographics and crafting tailored financial strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Affluent describes the client segment representing individuals with significant financial resources, applicable to Danielle Johnson and Jill Rhodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Affluent is a segment classification indicating Patricia Miller's client status, reflecting her financial profile.&lt;SEP&gt;Affluent refers to clients who have a high level of wealth, noted in relation to both Tasha Valencia and Alexander Le.&lt;SEP&gt;Affluent is a segment classification for Daniel Graham, indicating a higher net worth and financial capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-953ab721f5a61fc6ec578338aadbaf27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30c1e11d4c43f8fe4dcf18af53e6269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7f2ae0b2e3fefd66edfa4e5b9a87a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04d46a7da3b2f89c71a33e102f00ac9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15c4a91ae63443fd388c9fe5ca9c5e88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6c8d77580ab9fcf610fd9899cdd69d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21228275225d46e0a65f6db9f2e087e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b6c7b7e2bcdbbd7fe2d899801806561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e86d59d9819aff5dd36dfe882b91d489&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-393284f0a0bd836432f47367a65ac20a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad6629df08db071fd48dcc421bbbeb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf46d7a8810ed9b80f8b5dc694602629&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f0d4c9ac6495ce34275de33d6a4d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2240d554dd1d94821c1ab8127b88862</data>
