</node>
<node id="Affluent Client">
  <data key="d0">Affluent Client</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The term "Affluent Client" refers to individuals with considerable financial means, typically characterized by higher income and investment capabilities. This classification includes clients who possess significant wealth, albeit not necessarily at the level of high-net-worth individuals. Affluent clients generally exhibit moderate to high risk profiles and have diverse financial goals, often seeking tailored financial services to manage their investments effectively.

Individuals categorized as affluent, such as Deborah, George, and Anthony Gonzalez, are recognized for their substantial financial resources, which allow them to engage in complex financial discussions and sophisticated investment strategies. The profile of an Affluent Client encompasses a variety of individuals with significant assets, including Linda Wolfe, who likewise demonstrates a moderate level of wealth.

Affluent clients are actively involved in wealth management and investment strategies, reflecting their desire to optimize their financial portfolios and achieve specific financial objectives. In summary, the term "Affluent Client" collectively describes individuals with noteworthy financial capabilities, intent on navigating the complexities of investment and wealth management to align with their personalized financial ambitions.</data>
